sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant J as Joined user
    participant API as Circl API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant R as Background jobs
    participant W as Next in line (party of 2)

    J->>API: DELETE /activities/42/participants/me
    API->>DB: participant LEFT, seats_taken - 2, ledger -2
    API->>DB: first WAITING party that fits gets OFFERED,<br/>seats held, claim_deadline = now + 15 min
    API->>DB: outbox WaitlistOffered, COMMIT
    R->>DB: poll outbox (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
    R->>DB: notification "2 seats opened up, claim before 7:45 pm"
    R-->>W: seat count over SSE, page shows the offer and a countdown
    alt claims in time
        W->>API: POST /waitlist/offers/{id}/claim
        API->>DB: UPDATE waitlist SET status = CLAIMED<br/>WHERE id = ? AND status = OFFERED AND claim_deadline > now()
        DB-->>API: 1 row
        API->>DB: INSERT participant (party of 2), ledger CLAIM, COMMIT
        API-->>W: 200 JOINED
    else lets it expire
        R->>DB: offer expiry job (ShedLock): status OFFERED to EXPIRED
        R->>DB: seats go to the next party that fits, new 15 min offer
    end
    Note over API,DB: claim and expiry both use "UPDATE ... WHERE status = OFFERED",<br/>so only one of them can win
